{"title": "Mephistopheles", "pageid": 9456, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mephistopheles", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Fiends", "Archdevils"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Mephistopheles</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"title\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Archdevil of Cania</div>\n</div><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Custom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Custom.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> (son)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Cania, <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Hells\" title=\"Nine Hells\">Nine Hells</a></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiend\" title=\"Fiend\">Fiend</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Archdevil</div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n<p><b>Mephistopheles</b> is the archdevil ruler of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cania\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cania\">Cania</a></span>, the eighth layer of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Hells\" title=\"Nine Hells\">Nine Hells</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Tieflings</a> of his bloodline, the <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling#Mephistopheles_tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Mephistopheles Tieflings</a>, are empowered with some of his renowned magic skills.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Mephistopheles does not appear in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i>, but his presence can nonetheless be felt in many of the questlines and other game elements.\n</p><p>Mephistopheles specializes in infernal rituals, one of which is known as \"The Rite of Profane Ascension\". The ritual involves the sacrifice of seven thousand souls to the archdevil. In exchange, the vampire performing it becomes a \"Vampire Ascendant\", gaining additional powers and nullifying many of a traditional vampire's weaknesses, like burning in the sun or their sanguine hunger.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In one of the game's questlines <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Pale Elf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">The Pale Elf</a>, the vampire lord <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/25px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/38px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/50px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cazador Szarr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/25px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a> (and perhaps <a href=\"/wiki/Vellioth\" title=\"Vellioth\">Vellioth</a> before him) seeks to perform this ritual, acquiring sacrifices through his vampire spawn, one of whom is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>. Cazador has inscribed the backs of both his spawn and sacrifices with Infernal runes, necessary if the rite is to be performed.\n</p><p>A direct reference to him is made when a party member interacts with the Orb of Infernal Visioning in the <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a> after <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> has been killed. The narrator then describes a vision showing Mephistopheles consuming Raphael's bloodied body.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>After the fall of <a href=\"/wiki/Netheril\" title=\"Netheril\">Netheril</a>, Mephistopheles sequestered the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/17px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/26px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/34px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crown of Karsus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/17px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\">Crown of Karsus</a> in one of his archival vaults. His son, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>, coveted the crown, but was unable to obtain it for over a thousand years. Eventually, the crown was stolen by the cult of the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>, and Raphael put into motion his plans to take it for himself.\n</p><p>The incubus <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haarlep\" title=\"Haarlep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/25px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/38px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/50px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haarlep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png/25px-Portrait_Haarlep.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Portrait_Haarlep.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haarlep\" title=\"Haarlep\">Haarlep</a> has been sent by Mephistopheles to distract his \"naughty son\", possibly from his ambitions for the crown.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mass_Scroll\" title=\"Black Mass Scroll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mass_Scroll\" title=\"Black Mass Scroll\">Black Mass Scroll</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hells_Unleashed\" title=\"The Hells Unleashed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hells_Unleashed\" title=\"The Hells Unleashed\">The Hells Unleashed</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Pale Elf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">The Pale Elf</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" styl